        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 98C2009, 98C Series Traditional Solid Brass Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA hook such as this is as useful in the kitchen as it is in the bathroom. A stylish way to hang a robe, towels, or even a lady's purse, its a beautiful way to keep things off the floor in any room. This bathroom towel hook is made out of solid brass with the attention to quality that Deltana is known for. The 98C Series Robe Hook has a classic steeped rose for a traditional look. It is available in either satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-98C2009_specifications.gif?v=1704442276\" width=\"580\" height=\"254\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 98C2009 Single Robe Hook\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=382603\"><b>Deltana 98C Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 98C Solid Brass Classic Single Robe Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-98C2009.pdf?v=1691095360\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 98C2009 Single Robe Hook Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 robe hook, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>",
